- Fine, I get it, you work here,

00:06:53.986 --> 00:06:54.937
you always get to do the clap.

00:06:54.937 --> 00:06:55.770
- It's not like that, Shawn!

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:56.653
- You don't wanna give it to other people.

00:06:56.653 --> 00:06:57.561
- You know it's not like that!

00:06:57.561 --> 00:06:59.524
- You know what, today
has just been wrong.

00:06:59.524 --> 00:07:00.773
- It's been wrong?
- Yeah!

00:07:00.773 --> 00:07:02.023
- I invite you over to my company

00:07:02.023 --> 00:07:03.589
to make a video for your
fans and I did wrong?

00:07:03.589 --> 00:07:05.601
- You forced me to kiss
people on the forehead

00:07:05.601 --> 00:07:06.699
and you know I didn't want
to kiss them on the forehead!

00:07:06.699 --> 00:07:07.694
- I thought you would like it,

00:07:07.694 --> 00:07:08.760
you have a song about kissing, Shawn!

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:09.713
- Not on the forehead!

00:07:09.713 --> 00:07:10.951
- Well, I don't know!

00:07:10.951 --> 00:07:12.207
Maybe I'm jealous.

00:07:12.207 --> 00:07:14.001
- And it was mostly, I
was upset in the song.

00:07:14.001 --> 00:07:15.629
- Maybe I'm just dumb, Shawn!

00:07:15.629 --> 00:07:16.462
- Don't say that!

00:07:16.462 --> 00:07:17.326
- Maybe I'm just dumb!

00:07:17.326 --> 00:07:18.159
- No.

00:07:18.159 --> 00:07:19.125
(crying)

00:07:19.125 --> 00:07:20.019
Come here.

00:07:20.019 --> 00:07:23.602
(dramatic emotional music)

00:07:56.915 --> 00:07:58.478
- You film this?

00:07:58.478 --> 00:07:59.697
- Come on, Shawn!

00:07:59.697 --> 00:08:01.447
Let's get outta here.

00:08:06.446 --> 00:08:08.446
- Goodbye, Shawn Mendes.

00:08:09.937 --> 00:08:11.770
I'll never forget you.

00:08:13.661 --> 00:08:14.697
(sighs)

